Subject: [PATCH] LICENSE-MADEIRA: record third-party contributions and direct
 commits

The notice said every downstream change is one of the 51 cherry-picked
commits. That stopped being true once work continued on this branch, and a
contributor's commit has now been merged. State that later changes land here
directly, and list third-party contributions with their authors, who keep
their copyright under LGPL-2.1-or-later.

